BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 319.41 Tm (- The chiller COMPRESSOR only. Fans, chilled-water pumps, condenser pumps and cooling-tower fans keep) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 308.21 Tm (  running, and an airside economizer moves MORE air, so fan power can rise. The unmeasured term has the) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 297.01 Tm (  OPPOSITE SIGN, so this is an upper bound.) Tj ET
