BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 272.93 Tm (  beat it, and a better chiller saves less per hour switched off.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 260.05 Tm (- Full-load kW/ton OVERSTATES the draw at the moment free cooling is available, because free cooling) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 248.85 Tm (  happens when it is cool and a chiller at a cool condenser runs below its rating. IPLV is the lower) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 237.65 Tm (  published number but is an annual-weighted metric under AHRI's assumed load profile, not the) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 226.45 Tm (  part-load point free-cooling weather sits at.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 213.57 Tm (- The heat rejected is APPROXIMATED by the IT load. UPS, PDU and lighting losses inside the envelope) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 202.37 Tm (  add to it; some overhead sits outside the cooled space, so scaling by full PUE would overshoot. No) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 191.17 Tm (  PUE multiplier is applied.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 178.29 Tm (- EIA STATE-SECTOR AVERAGES, not the site's tariff. A Loudoun County campus buys on a) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 167.09 Tm (  large-general-service contract that is not public.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 154.21 Tm (- No carbon, no water, no maintenance and no demand charges. Tower water use moves the OTHER way when) Tj ET
